--- task
id: t07
dataset: section8
kind: interface binding

--- intent
List the name of everything that has a name, people and companies alike, in one result.

--- edition3
query names() {
  match {
    from union(
      { match { $p: Person } return { $p.name as name } },
      { match { $c: Company } return { $c.name as name } })
  }
  return { $name }
}

--- note
Both editions refuse an interface as a node type (`T1`): edition 2 today, and edition 3 until stage Poly adds the polymorphic `Scan` (the RFC's before-and-after corpus, "Interface binding"). The edition-3 answer is the `union` of the implementors; edition 2 has none in one query.
